{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のブログにセトリとか載せてるので\nそっちも見てね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからは細かく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1公演目のみの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『無表情』は\nきいちゃんとらりんのスマイル姉妹！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2公演目のみの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の『乃木團』やっちゃいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年ぶりかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥とまいまいも\nかけつけてくれたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にタオル投げました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥が涙を拭いたやつ\nと言ってましたが\n中田は本番前に手汗をずっと拭いてたやつです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受け取ってくれたかたごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾なつかしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやりたいな乃木團"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木團すごく好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『生まれたままで』の間奏の\nらりんとのあの絡みは\nいつも以上に全力でやりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2列目だから\nらりと中田をずーっと見ててくれてる人しか\n知らないかもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回やってたし\n今やフリの１つかのようにクセでやっちゃうんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバーがアンダーで入っても\nもうやることはないだろうから\nこれがラストでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『遠回りの愛情』は\nオリジナルメンバー94年組の\nアンダーのみで歌わせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり\nらり、愛未、中田の3人で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴かせる系の曲のソロは\nほんと緊張するんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ダンケシェーン』では\n3F席へ行かせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『シャキイズム』ではトロッコに乗りました！\nらりんと2回もチューしちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口にチューされ\n逆にチューしにいきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて\n自分からメンバーにしにいきました` ･ω･ ´w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終公演のみの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『不等号』は初披露でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14thアンダー曲になります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスパートがあったり\nかっこいい振付になってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はひなちまがいなかったから\nオリジナルとはちょっと違う位置にいたり\n歌割りもフォローしたりだったから\n今度ひなちまも含めて\nちゃんと披露できるのが楽しみだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ひとりよがり』は\nらりんが一人で歌いあげました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田まで\nステージ裏で泣きそうになってしまいました(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ロマンティックいか焼き』\nわがまま言えば\nオリジナルの2サビで\nらりんと二人でやるどこよりも激しいいか焼き\nまたやりたかったなーって思った(´･_･`)w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wアンコールがきて\n『ダンケシェーン』を歌うことに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして急遽ステージ上で\n『ハウス！』も歌うことに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はらりんと一緒の歌割りとか隣の立ち位置とか多かったから\n1曲1曲終わる度に\n「一緒に歌うの最後かー」って考えちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ中何度も泣いて\n武道館の卒業発表時も泣いて\n実はリハで2回も泣いたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最後は笑顔で終われた\nらりんらしい卒業コンサートでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビジネスレズとか\nハム姉妹とか\nなんかいろいろあったね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか明日も仕事行けば\nらりんいる気がしちゃう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで頼りっきりでごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/21/6172470/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}